## Description: Query ESO game data with SQL: abilities, skills, sets, effects, items, achievements, collectibles, zones, champion points and more. Keep notes and lists in your own saved tables with INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE. /esql on PC, Settings > Addons > ESQL on console.
